        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaini nende Abeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adamu naba nende Hawa omukhasiwe; naye nahela inda, niyeebula Kaini, naboola ari Enyoolile omwana oweshisaatsa khulwa obukhoonyi bwOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma khandi niyeebula Abeli omwana wabwe. Naye Abeli yali omwayi wamakondi, ne Kaini yali omulimi weliloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olunyuma lwetsindaalo Kaini yamala naleerela OMWAMI ebiamo bieliloba khulwa omusango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeli naye naleera ebimeeme biambeli ebiomurukokwe nende amasinya kabio. OMWAMI nafuchiilila Abeli nende omusangokwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne shiyafuchiilila Kaini nomusango kukwe tawe. Oburima nibuhamba Kaini muno, mana nakhuunia mumoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nareeba Kaini ari Oburima bukhuhambile mbushi? Khandi olwashiina nokhuuniye mumoni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noba nokhola obulayi, shinofuchiililwe? Ne noba norakhola obulayi ta, kho obwonooni bukhukonesheele hamuliango; obwikombi bwabwo buli khwiwe; ne okhoyile okhubeetsanga nende oburuchi khubwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaini naboolela Abeli omwana wabwe ari Chenda khutsie mumukunda. Kho olwa bali mumukunda bosi, Kaini namurulilakhwo Abeli omwana wabwe, namwira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nareeba Kaini ari Omwana weenywe Abeli ali heena? Naye namukalusia ari Shimanya tawe; endi omulindi womwana weefwe noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboola ari Okholile orie iwe? Omwoyo kwamabanga komwana weenywe kuhaabilanga okhurula khwiloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano oli mushilaamo shiobubii eshikhwahukhasia nende liloba eliasaame omunwa kwalio okhunyoola amabanga komwana weenywe akarulile mumukhonokwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhurula olwa leelo, olwa olhna liloba, shililakhuheelesinjia amaani kalio tawe; obeetsenje omuboyaboyi notiimatiima khushibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaini nasunjila OMWAMI ari Aka ndichemeele namakhongo aka ndaranyala okhwifwila ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, unzilusiye inyanga yino khwiloba; khandi ndalashingungwa okhukhulola; ndalabeetsanga omuboyaboyi nindiimatiima khushibala; khandi kalabeetsanga mbu ounyoola alanzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namuboolela ari Niko akachila oulimwira Kaini, alimalilwakhwo eshikwoli khandi musaafu. OMWAMI naheelesia Kaini eshilolelo, mbu omundu yesi oumunyoola aleshe okhumwira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaini narula ewa OMWAMI yali, namenya mushialo shiaNodi khulubeka Iwebukwe lwaEdeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaini naba nende omukhasiwe; naye nahela inda niyeebula Enoka; mana Kaini niyoombakha olukala, nakulikha olukala olwo mbu Enoka, khuliira liomwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Enoka yeebula Iradi; Iradi niyeebula Mehuyaeli; Mehuyaeli niyeebula Metushaeli; Metushaeli niyeebula Lamekhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Lamekhu naleera abakhasi babili; ameera kabwe, mulala mbu Ada, oundi mbu Zila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ada niyeebula Yabali; niye kuuka wa abo abamenya mumaheema, abemiruko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neliira liomusiani wabwe niye Yubali; niye kuuka wabakhupi bobukhana nende lilele bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Zila yesi niyeebula Tubalikaini, omwibaali wobwiraanyi bwemikasa nende ebibia; khandi omukhaana wabwe Tubalikaini niye Naama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tsinzibulo tsiaSetsi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adamu naba nende omukhasiwe khandi; niyeebula omwana omusiani, namukulikha eliira mbu Setsi; ari Okhuba Nyasaye areelehol khulwanje olwibulo lundi mushilenje shiaAbeli; shichila Kaini yamwira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Setsi yesi yeebula omwana omusiani, namukulikha eliira mbu Enoshi; mana abandu nibachaaka okhwikayakaya khuliira liaOMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
